      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "World this behaviour can be tested in: https://vrchat.com/i/cloak-disruptxyzzy-2e169\n1. After spawning walk to the white cube next to the spawn (near the \"tunnel\")\n2. make sure to stand on the side closer to the spawn to be inside the disabled trigger\n3. click the white cube to enable the trigger\n4. check the Log for \"OnPlayerTriggerEnter\" (does not appear currently)\n5. click the white cube twice to disable and enable the trigger again\n6. in the  Log the \"OnPlayerTriggerEnter\" should have appeared\n(As an alternative to checking the log you can test whether other players that are not in the trigger can not hear you, if it was working you would not be able to hear players not in the trigger and they would not be able to hear you inside the trigger as soon as it becomes visible).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
