      "value": "@{5f4c34d0995917085be1218d|full_name}: Oh! Thanks for the correction, and for explaining the issue further. I thought Enter and Stay had the same rules as Exit,   I should have checked the docs before replying here. I'll correct my statement above and look into this issue further.",
